    "body": "# Bug report\n\n### Bug description:\n\nLeakSanitizer detects memory leaks when running `test_import` with the `_testsinglephase` module loaded in a subinterpreter.\n\n### How to Reproduce\n\n**Build:**\n```bash\nCC=clang CXX=clang++ ./configure --disable-optimizations --with-pydebug --with-address-sanitizer && make -j$(nproc)\n```\n\n**Run:**\n```bash\n./python -X dev -X showrefcount -m test test_import -j0\n```\n\n### Leak Summary\n\n```\n==643791==ERROR: LeakSanitizer: detected memory leaks\nSUMMARY: AddressSanitizer: 6709 byte(s) leaked in 45 allocation(s).\n```\n\n### Code Locations\n\nThe leaks originate from:\n\n**Subinterpreter execution:**\n- https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e8e0f411bae1dde634fb152a81e1db1ad1cd2eaa/Modules/_testcapimodule.c#L1223\n  (`run_in_subinterp`)\n\n**Module initialization:**\n- https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e8e0f411bae1dde634fb152a81e1db1ad1cd2eaa/Modules/_testsinglephase.c#L516\n  (`init__testsinglephase_basic`)\n- https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e8e0f411bae1dde634fb152a81e1db1ad1cd2eaa/Modules/_testsinglephase.c#L303\n  (`init_state` with `PyErr_NewException`)\n\n**Import machinery:**\n- https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e8e0f411bae1dde634fb152a81e1db1ad1cd2eaa/Python/importdl.c#L429\n  (`_PyImport_RunModInitFunc`)\n\n### Leaked Objects\n\n- Type objects (1016 bytes × 2): via `type_new` → `PyErr_NewException`\n- Dictionary keys (424 bytes × 2): via `new_keys_object` → `PyDict_SetItemString`\n- PyCMethod objects (384 bytes × 2 groups): via `PyModule_AddFunctions`\n- Additional: Unicode strings, tuples, dictionaries\n\n### Full Output\n\nSee attached `.log` files for complete LeakSanitizer output for each version.\n\n[312.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23016702/312.log)\n[313.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23016700/313.log)\n[314.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23016703/314.log)\n[main.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23016701/main.log)\n\n### CPython versions tested on:\n\n3.12, 3.13, 3.14, 3.15, CPython main branch\n\n### Operating systems tested on:\n\nLinux",
